<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῡρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make into cheese, curdle,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.683
			</span></i>, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.86
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτύρωσάς με ἴσα τυρῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jb.</u>
					10.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτυρώθη ὡς γάλα ἡ καρδία
			αὐτῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ps.</u>
				118(119).70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make a mess of</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρεύω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυροῦντες ἅπαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archestr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					45.13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρωθέντα: ταραχθέντα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make</i> or <i>season with cheese,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦντες τετυρωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					1.72
				</span></i>
			.</div>
